      "function": "check_buffer",
      "line": null,
      "code": "ut16 rec_size = ut8p_bw (buf + 1);",
      "note": "The macro `ut8p_bw(x)` expands to `((x)[0] | ((x)[1] << 8))`, so with `x = buf + 1` the first load already touches `buf[1]`, which is one byte past the end of the region `[buf, buf + 1)` allocated in `get_whole_buf`.",
